codex
The red tests reproduce the missing mask mapper and both launcher/evaluation stops. For seed separation, I’m adding a conservative startup budget that reserves seeds for construction, resets, truncation, and a final full update. It will reject limits that could reach the evaluation band; launches without a step limit will receive a very large safe ceiling.


